    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例1化简  $\\sin 50^{\\circ}(1 + 3\\tan 10^{\\circ})$",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            638,
            403,
            653
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解答：",
        "text_level": 1,
        "bbox": [
            144,
            669,
            196,
            684
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "原式",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            700,
            189,
            715
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例2在△ABC中，  $a = 2,b = 2,A = 45^{\\circ}$  ，求角B和边c。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            731,
            556,
            746
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解答：",
        "text_level": 1,
        "bbox": [
            144,
            762,
            196,
            778
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "list",
        "sub_type": "text",
        "list_items": [
            "1. 由正弦定理  $\\sin Aa = \\sin Bb$  ，得  $\\sin B = ab\\sin A = 22\\times 22 = 21$",
            "2.  $\\because a > b$  ，∴A>B，则  $B = 30^{\\circ}$",
            "3.  $C = 180\\circ -A - B = 105\\circ$  ，  $\\sin 105\\circ = \\sin (60\\circ +45\\circ) = 46 + 2$",
            "4. 由正弦定理  $\\sin C = \\sin A$  ，得  $c = \\sin A\\sin C = 222 \\times 46 + 2 = 3 + 1$  。"
        ],
        "bbox": [
            174,
            793,
            689,
            900
        ],
        "page_idx": 2
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "四、数列",
        "text_level": 1,
        "bbox": [
            146,
