    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "1. 等差数列",
        "text_level": 1,
        "bbox": [
            176,
            149,
            285,
            165
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "list",
        "sub_type": "text",
        "list_items": [
            "。通项公式：an=al+(n-1)d（d为公差）。",
            "。求和公式：  $\\mathrm{Sn = 2n(a1 + an) = na1 + 2n(n - 1)d}$",
            "$\\mathrm{O}$  性质：若  $\\mathrm{m + n = p + q}$  ，则  $\\mathrm{am + an = ap + aq}$"
        ],
        "bbox": [
            236,
            180,
            608,
            259
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "2. 等比数列",
        "text_level": 1,
        "bbox": [
            176,
            273,
            285,
            288
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "list",
        "sub_type": "text",
        "list_items": [
            "。通项公式：an=alqn-1（q为公比，  $q\\cdot = 0$  ）。",
            "$\\circ$  求和公式：  $\\mathrm{Sn = \\{na11 - qal(1 - qn) = 1 - qal - anq(q = 1)(q\\bullet = 1)}$  。",
            "$\\mathrm{O}$  性质：若  $\\mathrm{m + n = p + q}$  ，则am·an=ap·aq。"
        ],
        "bbox": [
            236,
            304,
            761,
            382
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "3. 数列求和方法: 裂项相消法 (如  $n(n + 1)l = n1 - n + 11$ )、错位相减法 (等差  $\\times$  等比型数列)、分组求和法。",
        "bbox": [
            174,
            395,
            847,
            434
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "典型习题示例",
        "bbox": [
            146,
            449,
            263,
            464
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例1已知等差数列  $\\{\\mathrm{an}\\}$  中，  $a3 = 5$  ，  $a5 = 9$  ，求数列  $\\{\\mathrm{an}\\}$  的通项公式和前  $\\mathbf{n}$  项和Sn。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            480,
            793,
            495
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解答：",
        "text_level": 1,
        "bbox": [
            144,
            511,
            194,
            527
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "list",
        "sub_type": "text",
        "list_items": [
            "1. 设公差为  $\\mathrm{d}$ ，则  $\\{\\mathrm{a1} + 2\\mathrm{d} = 5\\mathrm{a1} + 4\\mathrm{d} = 9$ ，解得  $\\{\\mathrm{a1} = 1\\mathrm{d} = 2$ 。",
            "2. 通项公式：  $\\mathrm{an} = 1 + (\\mathrm{n} - 1) \\times 2 = 2\\mathrm{n} - 1$",
            "3. 前  $n$  项和：  $\\mathrm{Sn} = 2\\mathrm{n}(1 + 2\\mathrm{n} - 1) = \\mathrm{n}2$"
        ],
        "bbox": [
            174,
            542,
            613,
            620
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "例2求数列  $\\{\\mathrm{n}(n + 2)1\\}$  的前  $\\mathfrak{n}$  项和Tn。",
        "bbox": [
            144,
            634,
            460,
            651
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "text",
        "text": "解答：",
        "text_level": 1,
        "bbox": [
            144,
            665,
            194,
            682
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "list",
        "sub_type": "text",
        "list_items": [
            "1. 裂项： $n(n + 2)1 = 21(n1 - n + 21)$ 。",
            "2. 求和："
        ],
        "bbox": [
            176,
            697,
            450,
            744
        ],
        "page_idx": 3
    },
    {
        "type": "equation",
